---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How DeepTek handles personal data submitted through this website.">
  <PageHero label="Legal" title="Privacy notice." lead="Last updated: October 2026. This is a starting draft and should be reviewed by a legal adviser before launch." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by {site.legalName} ("DeepTek", "we"), based in the United Arab Emirates. We are
        responsible for the personal data described in this notice.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the contact form we receive the details you enter: your name, email address, and optionally your
        company, phone number, budget range and message. If you message us on WhatsApp, we receive your phone number,
        profile name and the messages you send.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking. We may use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits.
        It does not set cookies, does not use your IP address to identify you and only produces anonymous totals such as
        page views and country.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your details only to reply to your enquiry and, if you become a client, to deliver our services and meet
        our legal obligations. We do not sell your details or share them for marketing.
      </p>

      <h2>Services we rely on</h2>
      <p>
        The website is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare Turnstile protects the form from spam and may process technical
        data such as your IP address. Form submissions reach us by email through a transactional email provider.
        WhatsApp is provided by Meta, and conversations there are also covered by WhatsApp's own privacy policy. Some of
        these providers may process data outside the UAE, with appropriate safeguards.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries are kept for up to 24 months unless we start working together. Client records are kept for as long as
        UAE law requires.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021) you can ask to access, correct or
        delete your personal data, or object to how we use it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
        or call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a> and we will respond promptly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
